/E (Despite the essential services provided by pharmacies and convenience stores, several operational issues still persist. Many establishments continue to rely on manual processes in managing inventory and sales transactions, resulting in inefficiencies, inaccurate records, and delays in daily operations. In addition, outdated scanning systems contribute to slow transaction processing and customer dissatisfaction.)
