/T (Furthermore, the study highlighted that inventory management systems contribute to better customer service because employees can quickly check product availability and process transactions more efficiently. The use of technology also helped pharmacies save time and improve productivity in their daily operations. According to the findings of the study, businesses that adopt computerized systems are more capable of maintaining accurate inventory data and improving overall operational performance.)
/E (Furthermore, the study highlighted that inventory management systems contribute to better customer service because employees can quickly check product availability and process transactions more efficiently. The use of technology also helped pharmacies save time and improve productivity in their daily operations. According to the findings of the study, businesses that adopt computerized systems are more capable of maintaining accurate inventory data and improving overall operational performance.)
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [1]
>>
