/E (2.4 Synthesis of the Reviewed Literature The reviewed foreign and local studies demonstrate that automated inventory systems significantly improve operational efficiency and accuracy. However, limited research focuses on integrated systems for pharmacy and convenience store operations. This study addresses this gap by developing an Automated Inventory Management System, aligning with established MIS frameworks and proven system implementations.)
