/Title (The findings of the study revealed that automated inventory management systems significantly improved inventory accuracy and operational efficiency within manufacturing firms. Through automation, organizations were able to track inventory levels more accurately and update inventory information in real time. This reduced the occurrence of inventory discrepancies caused by manual recording and minimized errors in stock monitoring. The researchers explained that real-time inventory updates enabled organizations to respond more quickly to inventory shortages and operational problems, helping improve workflow and supply chain coordination.)
