/Title (. Unit Testing    - Tested individual Python functions    - Verified database CRUD operations    - Checked JavaScript functions . System Testing    - Tested complete user workflows    - Verified admin and cashier operations    - Tested sales processing end-to-end    - Validated inventory updates . User Acceptance Testing    - Admin tested all management features    - Cashiers tested sales processing    - Validated system meets requirements)
