/Title (Furthermore, the study found that RFID technology improved product tracking and inventory visibility throughout the supply chain. By using RFID tags and scanning technologies, companies were able to monitor product movement more efficiently and reduce problems such as misplaced inventory and delivery errors. The study also highlighted that ERP systems improved communication and information sharing among departments by centralizing inventory data into a unified digital platform. Because information could be accessed quickly and accurately, managers were able to make better decisions related to inventory replenishment, purchasing, and stock management.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1769 0 R
/Next 1986 0 R
>>
