/Title (We conduct interviews with pharmacy staff and customers to collect firsthand information about their experiences, opinions, and needs. Interviews allow us to gather detailed and personal insights directly from the people who work in or use the pharmacy. This helps us understand challenges, expectations, and areas for improvement.)
/Dest [70 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1770 0 R
>>
