/Title (The research also explained that Electronic Data Interchange \(EDI\) technologies improved communication between supply chain partners and helped organizations exchange business information electronically. This reduced delays associated with manual paperwork and improved transaction speed. In addition, Material Requirements Planning \(MRP\) systems improved production planning and inventory scheduling by helping companies determine the quantity of materials needed for operations. These technologies collectively improved organizational productivity and reduced operational risks associated with inventory management.)
