/Title (Another important finding of the study was the positive effect of automation on customer service and organizational performance. Because organizations were able to monitor inventory levels more effectively, products became more readily available and delivery delays were reduced. This improved customer satisfaction and strengthened business performance. The researchers emphasized that automation not only improves inventory accuracy but also enhances the ability of organizations to provide reliable and efficient services to customers.)
