/Title (Pressman and Maxim \(2019\) further provided a comprehensive framework for software engineering practices, including requirements analysis, system modeling, and quality assurance testing. Their practitioner-oriented approach supports the development methodology applied in this study, particularly in the structured design and iterative testing phases of the proposed AIMS.)
