/Title (The "Automated Inventory Management System for Pharmacy and Convenience Store" is designed to address the challenges of manual inventory tracking and sales management in pharmacies and convenience stores. This research aims to develop a comprehensive local network system that operates offline and streamlines operations including product management, sales processing, and inventory monitoring for both pharmacy and convenience store items.)
